 can provide more accurate, efficient, and effective solutions to complex problems.'}, 'choose model result': {'id': 'ChatGPT', 'reason': 'ChatGPT performs well on some NLP tasks as well.'}}, 1: {'task': {'task': 'summarization', 'id': 1, 'dep': [0], 'args': {'text': 'AI systems collaborate across modalities'}}, 'inference result': {'response': "The main topics in 'AI systems collaborate across modalities' include multimodal interaction, where AI systems process and integrate multiple forms of data such as text, images, and speech to achieve a common goal. This collaboration enables AI to better understand and generate human-like responses, improving overall performance in applications like human-computer interaction, natural language processing, and computer vision. Additionally, it involves the development of AI models that can seamlessly work across different modalities, enhancing their ability to learn, reason, and apply knowledge in various contexts."}, 'choose model result': {'id': 'ChatGPT', 'reason': 'ChatGPT performs well on some NLP tasks as well.'}}, 2: {'task': {'task': 'text-classification', 'id': 2, 'dep': [1], 'args': {'text': 'AI systems collaborate across modalities'}}, 'inference result': {'error': 'no available models on text-classification task.'}, 'choose model result': ''}}
